    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow is slowly falling outside. A girl named Anastasia, who lives in an old multi-story building, decides to leave her apartment. She goes to borrow some salt from her neighbors and find a treasure hidden in this house. But what kind of treasure is this, and is it worth looking for? Her neighbors are very strange, and Nastya will have to make a choice which one to go to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality mixes with nightmares, but the treasure is somewhere very close...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our visual novel you will find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Three neighbors with separate routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 A bright visual component, in which there is a large number of CG-arts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 The presence of choices that affect the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 As many as 10 endings!</p>",
